                <p class="uppercase umhd"> @ViewBag.gynae_system (ICD-10: C60-C68) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /> TOTAL CASES : @ViewBag.TotalCount  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   MALE : @ViewBag.malecount  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  FEMALE : @ViewBag.femalecount</p>
